=== Headers ===
Header              Line  Category      Role in this compiler
------------------------------------------------------------------------
<iostream>          2     I/O           enables cout / endl  - std::cout / std::cin streams
=== Three Address Code ===
    outs "Enter the first number: "
    read num1
    outs "Enter the second number: "
    read num2
    t1 = num1 + num2
    sum = t1
    outs "The sum is: "
    out sum
    outs "\n"
    goto L1
L1:
=== Optimized TAC ===
    outs "Enter the first number: "
    read num1
    outs "Enter the second number: "
    read num2
    sum = num1 + num2
    outs "The sum is: "
    out sum
    outs "\n"
